    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41522" body-key="w">
    
    
      alphabetical letter
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span></b> 

<i>The twenty-seventh letter of the alphabet;</i>
called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَاوٌ</span>: it is one of the class termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَفَهِيَّة</span> [or
labials], and is a letter of augmentation. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  For
the uses of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span> as a particle see Supplement; for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span>
in the sense of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بل</span> see a verse in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَدَ</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span>
giving fulness of sound to 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">1َ2ُ3َ</span></b> , see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَظَرَ</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span> used
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِلتَّذَكُّرِ</span>, see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الف التَّعَايِى</span> in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ا</span>, and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الف</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الإِسْتِنْكَارِ</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span> in the sense of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ب</span>, see a verse in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَسِيلَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  As a numeral it denotes <i>Six.</i>

